(text "J8 is a TC2050-IDC-NL pogo footprint.\nCUSTOM pinout: pin 6 is 3.3 V reference OUTPUT.\nUse a 3.3 V SWD / UART adapter and shared GND.\nBOOT0 normally low; reset is on J8 pin 1.\nCAN PA11/PA12 use AF4. LEDs are on CAN sheet." (at 246 225 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "36be1bd5-e84a-599e-89bc-dabcdb907abc"))
